ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Placard::
    .string "5F  LEARNING\p"
    .string "How a mind changes itself, one\n"
    .string "small join at a time.\p"
    .string "The syllabus is on the desk.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Syllabus::
    .string "COURSE SYLLABUS\n"
    .string "5F  LEARNING\p"
    .string "TOPICS: CONNECTIONS, PRACTICE,\n"
    .string "THRESHOLD, FEEDBACK, PRUNING.\p"
    .string "All of it is on the board.\n"
    .string "The exam covers the board.\p"
    .string "PASS MARK: 80 out of 100.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Connections::
    .string "CONNECTIONS\p"
    .string "A mind is cells joined to cells.\p"
    .string "Each join has a strength: how hard\n"
    .string "one cell pushes the next when it\l"
    .string "fires.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Practice::
    .string "PRACTICE\p"
    .string "Use a join and it grows stronger.\p"
    .string "Cells that fire together wire\n"
    .string "together, as the saying goes.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Threshold::
    .string "THRESHOLD\p"
    .string "A cell fires only when the pushes\n"
    .string "on it add up past a line.\p"
    .string "Some cells sit close to that line.\n"
    .string "They fire at almost nothing.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Feedback::
    .string "FEEDBACK\p"
    .string "Learning needs to find out how it\n"
    .string "went.\p"
    .string "Without that, practice only makes\n"
    .string "a habit, not a skill.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Pruning::
    .string "PRUNING\p"
    .string "Joins that are never used are\n"
    .string "taken away.\p"
    .string "Growing up is losing most of them,\n"
    .string "on purpose.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Teacher::
    .string "LEARNING.\p"
    .string "Everything you have read in this\n"
    .string "building changed something small\l"
    .string "in your head.\p"
    .string "This floor is about what.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Everywhere::
    .string "I learned about cells that fire\n"
    .string "together.\p"
    .string "Now I see it everywhere.\p"
    .string "The lights in the hall. The birds.\n"
    .string "My two uncles.$"

ViridianCity_School_5F_Text_Sleep::
    .string "I stayed up all night revising.\p"
    .string "Apparently the sleep is where it\n"
    .string "sticks.\p"
    .string "I have been doing this wrong\n"
    .string "for years.$"
